# Simple cubic (CsCl-type) NaCl fixture: 2 atoms, Na at the corner and Cl
# at the body center, a = 4.0 Ang -- 3D bulk (no vacuum axis), the
# simplest possible 2-species cell to exercise stb-optical's diagonal
# (xx/yy/zz) and biaxial (xy/xz/yz) direction folders plus
# stb-opticalAnalysis's off-diagonal eps_ij reconstruction.
SystemName Simple cubic NaCl (optical workflow test fixture)
SystemLabel siesta

LatticeConstant 4.0 Ang
%block LatticeVectors
  1.0000000000   0.0000000000   0.0000000000
  0.0000000000   1.0000000000   0.0000000000
  0.0000000000   0.0000000000   1.0000000000
%endblock LatticeVectors

NumberOfSpecies 2
%block ChemicalSpeciesLabel
 1  11  Na
 2  17  Cl
%endblock ChemicalSpeciesLabel

NumberOfAtoms 2
AtomicCoordinatesFormat Fractional
%block AtomicCoordinatesAndAtomicSpecies
 0.0  0.0  0.0  1
 0.5  0.5  0.5  2
%endblock AtomicCoordinatesAndAtomicSpecies
